dead (404/401), most predating this session -- default-URL construction
(DEFAULT_CKPT_BASE_URL / DEFAULT_CONFIG_BASE_URL) guessing at filenames
that were never actually hosted at that generic path for most third-party
uploaders, not a single new regression.

